5. Workaround: set BUN_HMR_POLL=1 bun run dev', 2, NULL, 2, 6, NULL, NULL, 2, 4, NULL, 1, NULL, 2.0, 'Bun hot-reload crashes on Windows WSL2 after file rename', '2026-05-22 19:35:00.224402') RETURNING "id" /*application='DevTeam'*/[0m
