2. Start the dev server: bun run dev
3. Rename any .ts source file in VSCode (F2 or right-click → Rename)
4. Observe: Bun dev server crashes with ENOENT error
5. Workaround: set BUN_HMR_POLL=1 bun run dev', 2, NULL, 2, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, 2, 4, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, 2.0, 'Bun hot-reload crashes on Windows WSL2 after file rename', '2026-05-23 14:26:15.908215') RETURNING "id" /*application='DevTeam'*/[0m
