        <div class="card">
          <h3>How we will use Playwright</h3>
          <p>
            - Smoke suite on each deployment candidate.<br>
            - Full regression nightly and pre-release.<br>
            - Store traces/screenshots/videos as Jenkins artifacts.<br>
            - Link failing tests to notifications and report dashboards.
          </p>
