  <!-- RECOMMENDATION                                      -->
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div class="section" id="recommendation">
    <h2><span class="icon">🏆</span> Recommendation</h2>

    <div class="verdict-box">
      <div class="verdict-title">SonarQube Community Edition + Ollama AI Review</div>
      <div class="verdict-sub">On-premises, free, covers all our languages, with AI-assisted review for complex changes</div>
    </div>

    <h3>Why SonarQube Community Edition</h3>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Full language coverage</strong> — Ruby, C#, VB.NET, TypeScript, JavaScript, HTML, CSS, SQL — all in one tool.</li>
      <li><strong>Free and open source</strong> — Community Edition covers all our needs at zero license cost.</li>
      <li><strong>On-premises</strong> — Docker deployment on our existing Windows Server. No code leaves the network.</li>
      <li><strong>Quality Gates</strong> — Define pass/fail criteria for coverage, duplications, security hotspots, and code smells. Block merges that don''t meet standards.</li>
      <li><strong>Jenkins plugin</strong> — First-class <code>sonar-scanner</code> integration. Results post back to Gitea PRs.</li>
      <li><strong>OWASP Security</strong> — Built-in security rules for OWASP Top 10, CWE, and SANS vulnerabilities.</li>
      <li><strong>Historical trends</strong> — Track quality over time per project. Identify regression early.</li>
      <li><strong>IDE integration</strong> — SonarLint extension for VS Code and Visual Studio (free).</li>
    </ol>

    <h3>Why Add Ollama for AI Review</h3>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Fully on-premises</strong> — Ollama runs local LLMs (DeepSeek Coder V2, Qwen2.5-Coder 32B). No API calls to cloud.</li>
      <li><strong>Complements SonarQube</strong> — SonarQube catches rule-based issues; the AI reviews logic, naming, architecture, and design patterns.</li>
      <li><strong>Free</strong> — Open-source models. Only cost is hardware (GPU recommended but CPU works for small diffs).</li>
      <li><strong>Customisable prompts</strong> — We tailor review prompts per language and project conventions.</li>
    </ol>

    <h3>Architecture Overview</h3>
    <pre><code>┌──────────────┐    webhook     ┌──────────────┐    sonar-scanner    ┌──────────────┐
│   Gitea      │ ──────────────▸│   Jenkins    │ ──────────────────▸ │  SonarQube   │
│  (Git host)  │                │  (CI/CD)     │                     │  (Analysis)  │
└──────┬───────┘                └──────┬───────┘                     └──────┬───────┘
       │                               │                                    │
       │  PR comment (results)         │ review script                      │ Quality Gate
       │◂──────────────────────────────│◂───────────────────────────────────│ pass/fail
       │                               │
       │                        ┌──────▼───────┐
       │                        │   Ollama     │
       │◂───── AI suggestions ──│  (Local LLM) │
       │                        └──────────────┘
</code></pre>

    <div class="tip">
      <strong>💡 Phased rollout:</strong> Phase 1 — Deploy SonarQube + Jenkins integration (1–2 days). Phase 2 — Add Ollama AI review for the DevTeam Hub project (1 day). Phase 3 — Roll out AI review to all projects.
    </div>
  </div>

