## 8. Backup & Maintenance

| Task | Frequency | Command / Location |
|------|-----------|-------------------|
| Full backup of `JENKINS_HOME` | Daily | `robocopy C:\ProgramData\Jenkins\.jenkins D:\Backups\jenkins /MIR` |
| Update Jenkins core | Monthly | Manage Jenkins → Updates |
| Update plugins | Weekly | Manage Jenkins → Plugins → Updates tab |
| Rotate webhook token | Quarterly | Update credential in Jenkins + env var on server |
| Review disk usage | Monthly | Manage Jenkins → System Information → Disk Usage |
| Prune old builds | Per sprint | Blue Ocean → each pipeline → delete old runs |
